//@ run
//> == https basics (HC17)
//> get: 200 OK content-type=text/plain x-one=["1", "2"] fields=4 body="hello" url=https://127.0.0.1:PORT/greet?name=burdin
//> get sent: GET /greet?name=burdin HTTP/1.1 host=127.0.0.1:PORT agent=burdin-http/0.1 length=-
//> get handshakes: ["#1 TLSv1.3 sni=-"]
//> post: 201 Created body="stored"
//> post sent: POST /items HTTP/1.1 length=11 type=text/plain token=abc body="name=burdin"
//> server name: 200 body="named"
//> server name: handshakes ["#1 TLSv1.3 sni=localhost"] host=localhost:PORT
//> length: 100000 bytes, as sent: true
//> chunked: body="hello world" trailer=11
//> close-delimited: 200 body="until the end"
//> close-delimited: idle 0
//> bodies: accepted 1
//> keep-alive: 200 body="one"
//> idle after the first: 1
//> keep-alive: 200 body="two"
//> keep-alive: 200 body="three"
//> idle after three: 1
//> idle after close_idle: 0
//> keep-alive: accepted 1 and 1 handshakes
//> keep-alive: the server saw an orderly close: true
//> keep-alive: the server saw a cut: false
//> unread: 200 closed without reading the body
//> unread: the server saw an orderly close: true
//> https: 200 body="secure one"
//> http: 200 body="bare"
//> idle: 2
//> https again: 200 body="secure two"
//> pool keys: accepted 2
//> pool keys: #1 GET /a | #2 GET /b | #1 GET /c
//> pool keys: handshakes ["#1 TLSv1.3 sni=-"]
//> == redirects (HC12, HC17)
//> http -> https: 200 "landed" redirects=1 url=https://127.0.0.1:PORT/secure
//> http -> https got: GET /secure HTTP/1.1 authorization=- cookie=- x-custom=kept
//> https -> https (same origin): 200 "second" redirects=1 url=https://127.0.0.1:PORT/second
//> https -> https (same origin): accepted 1 second got GET /second HTTP/1.1 authorization=Bearer secret
//> https -> https (other origin): 200 "there" redirects=1 url=https://127.0.0.1:PORT/there
//> https -> https (other origin) got: GET /there HTTP/1.1 authorization=- x-custom=kept
//> https -> http: 200 "plain" redirects=1 url=http://127.0.0.1:PORT/downgraded
//> https -> http got: GET /downgraded HTTP/1.1 authorization=- cookie=- x-custom=kept
//> https -> http, not followed: 302 location=http://127.0.0.1:1/downgraded
//> == verification and configuration (HC17)
//> unknown authority: https connection failed: certificate verification failed: unable to get local issuer certificate tls=true verification=true kind=CertificateInvalid
//> unknown authority: accepted 1, handshakes failed 1, requests seen 0, completed 0
//> wrong host: https connection failed: the certificate does not match the host: 127.0.0.1 tls=true verification=true kind=HostnameMismatch
//> wrong host: accepted 1, handshakes failed 1, requests seen 0, completed 0
//> expired: https connection failed: certificate verification failed: certificate has expired tls=true verification=true kind=CertificateInvalid
//> expired: accepted 1, handshakes failed 1, requests seen 0, completed 0
//> self-signed: https connection failed: certificate verification failed: self-signed certificate tls=true verification=true kind=CertificateInvalid
//> self-signed: accepted 1, handshakes failed 1, requests seen 0, completed 0
//> skip verify, unknown authority: 200 body="served anyway"
//> skip verify, wrong host: 200 body="served anyway"
//> skip verify, expired: 200 body="served anyway"
//> skip verify, self-signed: 200 body="served anyway"
//> trust: 200 body="served"
//> tls_config: 200 body="served"
//> other store: tls=true verification=true kind=CertificateInvalid
//> clone: 200 body="served"
//> clone with its own store: tls=true verification=true kind=CertificateInvalid
//> original after the clone changed: 200 body="served"
//> configuration: accepted 6
//> == truncation, retries, and timeouts (HC13, HC14, HC17)
//> truncated length: the connection closed before the whole body arrived
//> truncated chunked: the connection closed before the whole body arrived
//> truncated close-delimited: the connection closed before the whole body arrived
//> close-delimited with close_notify: 200 body="until the end"
//> truncated: accepted 4
//> get retried: 200 body="second try"
//> get retried: accepted 2 and saw 2 requests, 2 handshakes
//> post not retried: the connection closed before a response was received
//> post not retried: accepted 1
//> stale (close_notify): 200 body="one"
//> stale (close_notify): 200 body="two"
//> stale (close_notify): accepted 2 and 2 handshakes
//> stale (cut): 200 body="one"
//> stale (cut): 200 body="two"
//> stale (cut): accepted 2 and 2 handshakes
//> handshake timeout: timed out while TLS handshake with 127.0.0.1:PORT is_timeout=true connection_failure=true tls=false
//> handshake timeout: ended well before the read timeout: true
//> plain port: tls=true verification=false kind=Handshake
//> silent close: tls=true verification=false kind=UnexpectedEof
//> plain port: accepted 2, requests seen 0

use https

fn main() {
    task.set_workers(4)
    https.run()
}
